  "creator_brief": "Create one reusable Skill for professional knowledge-work tasks that require producing user-requested files or other deliverables. The Skill will be reused across different tasks. Help the task-executing agent understand the request and provided materials, identify necessary research, select suitable tools and formats, construct the deliverables, check their content, appearance and relevant behavior, and report the outcome and limitations clearly.\n\nThe task-executing agent is responsible for any additional research, source selection, implementation, helper tools, dependencies, calculations and self-checks. The runtime supplies common isolated shell/Python/file processing, public research retrieval and document inspection/rendering tools. Do not assume personal settings, unlisted Skills, native desktop interaction, auxiliary AI services or unrestricted network access. Let the agent adapt to the capabilities actually exposed in its session.\n\nProduce a portable Skill with SKILL.md and any useful accompanying local resources in the requested output directory. Keep instructions useful within bounded execution time. Do not include task answers, benchmark-specific solutions, sample deliverables intended as answers, or assessment rubrics. No specific task statements or evaluation criteria are supplied for creation. Do not fetch benchmark tasks or solutions. Do not create an ALPS or non-ALPS comparison explanation: the output is a practical Skill for the task-executing agent.\n",
